Adalék EUROL Visco Oil Plus 250 ml:





	Eurol Visco Oil Plus is an additive developed to increase oil viscosity in petrol or diesel engines, with or without a turbo.   Use Eurol Visco Oil Plus if your engine consumes more than 1L of engine oil per 1000km, or if you expect it to run at extremely high temperatures. Eurol Visco Oil Plus increases oil viscosity, creating a thicker lubricating film between moving parts.   After adding Eurol Visco Oil Plus to your engine oil, your car runs smoothly with reduced vibration at idle. It restores compression, improves shear stability at high temperatures and high loads, boosts engine performance, and reduces fuel and oil consumption. Use a 250ml can of Eurol Visco Oil Plus for 4–6L of engine oil by adding the additive to warm engine oil. After adding the additive, let the engine idle for 10 minutes to ensure the oil mixes well. Eurol Visco Oil Plus is compatible with a wide range of engine oils.&nbsp;


















